{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 葛藟 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 葛藟 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《葛藟》的 5 条注释，含 5 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"071-ge-lei","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"071-ge-lei","title":"葛藟","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","葛藟"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"緜緜葛藟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"在河之滸","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"終遠兄弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"謂他人父","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"謂他人父","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"亦莫我顧","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"緜緜葛藟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"在河之涘","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"終遠兄弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"謂他人母","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"謂他人母","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"亦莫我有","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"緜緜葛藟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"在河之漘","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"終遠兄弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"謂他人昆","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"謂他人昆","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"亦莫我聞","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":5,"glossCount":5},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"葛藟㊟民窮無所依也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标题段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《葛藟》三章，章六句。此詩不必深解，但依《集傳》謂「世衰民散，有去其鄉里家族，而流離失所之作」，斯得之矣。若必謂「刺平王棄其九族」，則不惟「亦」字語氣不協，即詩意亦甚索然，反無謂也。葛藟本蔓生，必有所依而後附。今乃在河之滸與涘與漘，無喬木高枝以引其條葉，雖足自庇本根，而本根已失，奈之何哉？故人一去鄉里，遠其兄弟，則舉目無親，誰可因依？雖欲謂他人之父以爲父，而其父反愕然而不之顧。即欲謂他人之母以爲母，而其母亦恝然而不我親。父母且不可以僞託，況昆弟乎？則更澹焉如無聞也。民情如此，世道可知。誰則使之然哉？當必有任其咎者。即謂平王之棄其九族，而民因無九族之親者，亦奚不可。","targetNotes":"通篇总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"眉評沉痛語，不忍卒讀。","targetNotes":"眉评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 眉评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉评"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"集釋滸〔毛氏萇曰〕水厓曰滸。涘〔孔氏穎達曰〕《釋丘》云：「涘爲厓。」漘〔許氏謙曰〕岸上面平夷，而下爲水，洗蕩齧入若脣也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"標韻滸七麌。父同。顧七遇，叶果五反。叶韻。涘四紙。母二十五有。有同。叶韻。漘十一真。昆十三元。聞十二文。通韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵"}]}]}}}
